    "noise_floor": "every separability claim is judged against the within-stimulus replicate distribution from these same seeds, never against a fixed constant",
    "separability_design": "seed-matched: both stimuli run on the same seed list, and the same-seed diagonal is excluded from the between distribution so that both distributions consist only of differing-initial-phase pairs. An unmatched design (same odorant, seeds 1001-1008 vs 2001-2008) reported the stimulus separable from itself at p = 0.0017",
